# --- Private working docs — kept local only, never published ---
# This is a learning project. The planning corpus, concept notes, decision
# records, and prototype stay on the author's machine; the public repo leads
# with README.md and ABOUT.md instead. These files remain on disk (the agent
# tooling still reads them) — they are only removed from version control.
